  "title": "Covariance-Aware BAO Consistency Test of Energy-Flow Cosmology Using the BOSS DR12 Consensus Likelihood",
  "description": "Fixed-parameter consistency test of EFC modified background expansion against precision BAO data using the official BOSS DR12 consensus likelihood with full 6×6 covariance matrix. EFC yields Δχ² = -2.4 without parameter retuning.",
